          %p
            By the discussion at
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/adjoint+%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-functor"} adjoint (∞,1)-functor
            (
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Higher+Topos+Theory"}> HTT, prop. 5.2.2.8
            ) this requires exhibiitng a morphism
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi η
