          %h3#in_terms_of_products_and_equalizers In terms of products and equalizers
          %p
            A central theorem in ordinary
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category+theory"} category theory
            asserts that a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category"} category
            has
            = succeed "s" do
