                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Hom_F\big([r]\star D,C\big)
              is shorthand for the hom in the (ordinary)
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/under+category"} under category
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
