                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Z|_{Grpd} \to \infty Grpd^{op}
            be the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/universal+fibration+of+%28infinity%2C1%29-categories"} universal ∞-groupoid fibration
            whose fiber over the object denoting some
            = succeed "-groupoid" do
